  text: "Pedro Boyld, referred to as <link>Petro Boy</link> by his \u201Cacquaintances\u201D
    due to boringly obvious reasons, was born East of Wankchester near the skirts
    of <u>HiKen Biken</u> to <u>Mary Ann Boyld</u>, and attended to  \r\n----------------------------------------------
    \r\n               /<i>CONTEXTUAL EDIT</i>/\r\n----------------------------------------------    
    \r\n \r\n\r\r  \nNever knowing any better, he dropped out of his hobby to earn
    money on a dead-end job at a <link>Petro Station</link> that will probably hold
    any imitations of passion in check for the rest of his productive life cycle.
    \r\nQualified as adequate for his position he gets nervous pretty easily and
    usually leaves the station\u2019s <link>bathroom</link> door ajar after cleaning. 
    \n---------------------------------------------- \r\n               /<i>CONTEXTUAL
    EDIT</i>/\r\n----------------------------------------------     \r\n \r\n\r\n<b>BEHAVIORAL
    PROFILE:</b> He is afraid of authority and won\u2019t speak up unless feeling
    supported by the will of the many. He wouldn't make a threat to even an ant."
